WHAT THIS DOES NOT COVER

Presentations you build with this system are YOUR work. Attribution applies to
redistributing the system itself — the skill, the style guide, the venue
presets, the slide primitives — not to the decks it produces.

Decks generated by this system carry no Evidence & Air branding, no credit
line, and no authorship metadata belonging to anyone but you. That is by
design, and it is not an oversight to be "fixed".
